## Summary
Walmart is expanding its delivery services to include 30-minutes-or-less options. Customers are increasingly using these fast delivery services despite additional charges. Retail executives report that speed is attracting more shoppers.

## Key Points
- Walmart is rolling out 30-minutes-or-less delivery services.
- Customers are flocking to quick delivery options.
- Added charges for faster fulfillment are not deterring shoppers.
- Executives confirm that speed is a major factor in attracting customers.


